      "walkable": true,
      "_z": "Top sits a few centimetres proud of the ground plane, not level with it. A hollow is a colour patch laid on the map's one ground slab, and a patch whose top is exactly the slab's top is two faces on one plane -- which shimmers across the whole area as the camera moves. This one covered 246 studs on Woods and 382 on Holdfast, right through the middle of both. tools/check-zfight."
